<title>INDIA: India raises subsidy on imported fertilisers.</title>
<headline>India raises subsidy on imported fertilisers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India on Friday raised the subsidy on imported fertilisers for 1997/98 (April-March) to 19.5 bln rupees from 13.5 bln rupees in the previous year.</p>
</text>
